## internal/quicgo

The QUIC implementation, quic-go v0.65.0 (https://github.com/quic-go/quic-go), the non-test Go files of the packages the
connection needs. It is changed by internal/quicgo/PATCH, which adds a hook for a congestion controller, and its
import paths are rewritten to this module. The hook follows the one in apernet/quic-go (https://github.com/apernet/quic-go,
commit 2895f039137a, a fork of quic-go): internal/quicgo/congestion/interface.go is derived from that fork's
congestion/interface.go, and the adapter in internal/quicgo/internal/ackhandler/cc_adapter.go follows its design. The fork's
